> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT x, y, count(*) FROM gc2_d a JOIN gc2_d b USING (x, y) GROUP BY x, y ORDER BY x DESC, y
QUERY PLAN:text
Sort
  Sort Key: a.x DESC, a.y
  ->  HashAggregate
        Group Key: a.x, a.y
        ->  Nested Loop
              ->  Seq Scan on gc2_d a
              ->  Memoize
                    Cache Key: a.x, a.y
                    Cache Mode: logical
                    ->  Index Only Scan using gc2_d_x_y on gc2_d b
                          Index Cond: ((x = a.x) AND (y = a.y))
-- EXPLAIN

